    "title": "WNBA - Live Games & Scores",
    "description": "Keep up with the 2024 WNBA Playoffs Presented by Google! Stay locked in with the latest schedule, real-time scores, instant highlights, on-court analysis, and behind-the-scenes stories.\r\n\r\nAll W. All Here. Try to Keep Up.\r\n\r\nWatch more WNBA games, wherever you are, with WNBA League Pass for $34.99/year.\r\n\r\n- WNBA League Pass subscribers get access to:\r\n\r\n- Live out-of-market games\r\n\r\n- Full-length replays of every game\r\n\r\n- Hundreds of Classic games from previous seasons\r\n\r\nThe official WNBA app and WNBA League Pass features action from the Atlanta Dream, Chicago Sky, Connecticut Sun, Indiana Fever, New York Liberty, Washington Mystics, Dallas Wings, Las Vegas Aces, Los Angeles Sparks, Minnesota Lynx, Phoenix Mercury, and Seattle Storm.\r\n\r\nFans can download the WNBA App, then either sign into their existing WNBA League Pass account or purchase WNBA League Pass. \r\n\r\nWNBA League Pass automatically renews after one year unless canceled. Please contact the support team at leaguepasssupport@wnba.com if you are experiencing any issues.",
